ss=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-=
serif;mso-ligatures:none">This open-ended situation is very harmful to me. I=
 feel powerless, vulnerable, and extremely distressed. I find it impossible =
to put the children=E2=80=99s and my future into the respondent=E2=80=99s hands and <u>w=
ait without knowing how long I must wait.</u><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3D=
"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-ser=
if;mso-ligatures:none"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3D"MsoNormal"><spa=
n lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ligatures=
:none">I put the matter into Your Lordship=E2=80=99s hands and if one week is not =
enough, I am happy to wait as long as Your Lordship would like me to. <o:p><=
